      "thumbnailUrl": "https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/42915513/medium.jpg",
      "distinction": "Unlike other pinkgills in the Entoloma genus, aborted entoloma is the only one that regularly produces those characteristic lumpy, aborted forms."
