      "scientificName": "Entoloma strictius",
      "thumbnailUrl": "https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/96101692/medium.jpeg",
      "distinction": "Unlike the Aborted Entoloma which often has deformed, blob-like fruiting bodies, or the colorful Salmon Pinkgill with its bright orange-pink tones, the Straight-stalked Entoloma maintains a subdued brown appearance and that signature rigid stem."
